sequenceDiagram
    participant T as GoldenImageTests
    participant C as GoldenCases
    participant S as GoldenScene
    participant L as OneTextLabel
    participant K as GoldenComparer
    T->>C: CommittedRendererStamp() vs RendererStamp
    Note over T: mismatch or missing font -> Assert.Ignore
    T->>C: Find(name).Render()
    C->>S: new GoldenScene(w, h)
    Note over S: PrepareRendering: unity_GUIZTestMode, SharedGlyphAtlas.Reconfigure(force), DictionaryLineBreaker.ResetToDefaults
    C->>S: build(scene): Label / Mask / StencilMask ...
    S->>L: SetFont(bytes, fallbacks), Text, FontSize ...
    S->>S: Render(): ForceUpdateCanvases + camera.Render, twice
    S-->>T: Texture2D (RGBA32)
    T->>K: Compare(name, actual, BaselinePath)
    K-->>T: Result (Passed, DifferingPixels, WorstChannelDelta, Message)
    Note over K: on failure writes name_actual.png and name_diff.png to OutputDirectory
